1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,904
Day 47. The city fell in one night.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,432
No power. No signal. Just us.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,220
Alex! They're coming. The horde found the bridge.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,872
Hundreds of them. Maybe more.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,972
Look at them. They used to be people.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,728
Don't look at their faces. Look at their hands.

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,836
The radio said there's a safe zone. We move at dawn.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,184
Dawn is too late.

9
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,532
Run! Don't stop!

10
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:36,588
Left! Jump on three! One... two... three!

11
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,112
Don't let go!

12
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:41,100
Hold on! I've got you!

13
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:43,100
I won't. Not today.

14
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,772
The door is locked. Try the radio again.

15
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,408
Static... wait. Hear that?

16
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,640
Who's there? Show yourself!

17
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:57,820
The door opened by itself.

18
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,964
You shouldn't be here.
